OL,3,GNEWSAPlane pullers help charity push
OL,4,Atowards #500k
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people joined forces to
OL,7,Fpull a Boeing 737 and help a
OL,8,Flong-running charity challenge move
OL,9,Fcloser to raising half a million
OL,10,Fpounds.
OL,12,FThe Dorset Plane Pull returned to
OL,13,FBournemouth Airport earlier, with
OL,14,Fdozens of teams taking on the task of
OL,15,Fhauling the 35-tonne aircraft over 50m
OL,16,F(164ft).
OL,18,FThe annual event, now in its 17th year,
OL,19,Fbrings charities, businesses and
OL,20,Fcommunity groups together for a day of
OL,21,Ffundraising and friendly competition.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
