OL,3,GNEWSAPlane pullers help charity push
OL,4,Atowards #500k
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Richard Griffin said: "We all
OL,7,Fcome together once a year on a bank
OL,8,Fholiday Monday to do this mad thing and
OL,9,Fpull an aeroplane."
